  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;SAINT-PIERRE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Saint-Pierre is a small village in the French countryside where Daniel Caraminot resides after retiring from politics."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0437</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DANIEL CARAMINOT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Daniel Caraminot is a former French politician who chose to become a pensioner after a fulfilling yet demanding political career."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0437</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRENCH COUNTRYSIDE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The French countryside is where Daniel Caraminot lives, characterized by rolling hills and vineyards."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0437</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CORRIDORS OF POWER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Corridors of power refer to the political sphere where Daniel Caraminot once operated, emphasizing the intense and demanding nature of his political career."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0437</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PENSIONER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Pensioner is a person who collects a pension, representing a lifestyle choice for Daniel after his political career."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0437</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CUTTHROAT WORLD OF POLITICS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Cutthroat world of politics describes the competitive and challenging environment Daniel once navigated in his political career."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0437</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PUBLIC SERVICE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Public service is the passion that initially drove Daniel into politics, representing his commitment to making a difference in society."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0437</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRENCH NATIONAL ASSEMBLY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The French National Assembly is where Daniel served as a representative, highlighting his political career and influence."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0437</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMMITTEE ON AGRICULTURE AND RURAL DEVELOPMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Committee on Agriculture and Rural Development is where Daniel served, focusing on policies supporting farmers and rural development."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0437</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANCIENS AGRICULTEURS EXPLOITANTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Anciens Agriculteurs Exploitants is a socioprofessional category that Daniel advocated for, representing former farmer-operators in France."&lt;SEP&gt;"Anciens Agriculteurs Exploitants is the socioprofessional category Daniel Caraminot advocated for, representing former farmer-operators in France."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0437</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF LYON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The University of Lyon is where Daniel pursued higher education in agronomy, marking the beginning of his professional journey."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0437</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AGRICULTURAL CONSULTANT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An Agricultural consultant is the role Daniel held after his studies, providing guidance to farmers on best practices and sustainable farming methods."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0437</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AIN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ain is the rural constituency where Daniel was elected to the French National Assembly."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0437</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRENCH ASSOCIATION OF ANCIENS AGRICULTEURS EXPLOITANTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The French Association of Anciens Agriculteurs Exploitants is a non-profit organization Daniel led, advocating for the interests of former farmer-operators."&lt;SEP&gt;"The French Association of Anciens Agriculteurs Exploitants is the non-profit organization Daniel led, advocating for the interests of former farmer-operators."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0437</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LAW ON THE PROTECTION OF ANCIENS AGRICULTEURS EXPLOITANTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Law on the Protection of Anciens Agriculteurs Exploitants is a legislative achievement that provided additional support and resources for former farmer-operators."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Law on the Protection of Anciens Agriculteurs Exploitants is a piece of legislation Daniel helped pass, providing additional support for former farmer-operators."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Law on the Protection of Anciens Agriculteurs Exploitants is the piece of legislation Daniel helped pass in 2008, providing additional support for former farmer-operators."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0437</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LYON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lyon is the city where Daniel Caraminot was born."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0437</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MAY 12, 1965&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DATE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"May 12, 1965 is the birth date of Daniel Caraminot."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0437</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AGRONOMY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FIELD_OF_STUDY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Agronomy is the field of study Daniel Caraminot pursued at the University of Lyon."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0437</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AGRICULTURAL SCIENCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FIELD_OF_STUDY"</data>
